--- !u!114 &1188774984
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1188774811}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 808
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: "Legends say that a curse was laid upon the villagers of Transylvania.
    Every second child would inherit the curse of the werewolf. If a second child
    was born, they would usually be killed. But for those who can\u2019t bear the
    killing of a child, they would usually cast them off to another family not disclosing
    it\u2019s dark secret."
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 634040414}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1188774985
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 2
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1188774811}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec422cd568a9c4a31ad7c36d0572b9da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 809
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: "If legends are true, our suspect is most likely a Caucasian with a
    Transalvanian name. It\u2019s really hard to tell if one is Transalvanian unless
    they tell you. But from what I know, men have your typical biblical names like
    Daniel, Gabriel, or Samson, but the females usually have names that end with
    an \u201Ca\u201D like\_Ana-Maria, Mihaela, Andreea, Elena, Alexandra, Cristina,
    Daniela, Alina, Maria."
  description: 
  character: {fileID: 634040414}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
