  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemId: 1253
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: Well, I barely escaped with my life. Cherry thought I was dead after
    she bit me on the neck. Then Jamario and the man in the orange jump suit tried
    to save me and she came after them instead. Guess she never came back to finish
    me off.
